  "summary": "Malicious code in @servicetitan/cp-mfe-dev (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and then executes a bundled 727KB file (math_init.js) that is heavily obfuscated with a custom string-decoder, so its actual behaviour is concealed. The install-time execution of an undocumented, obfuscated payload is the observable risk; no network destination or exfil target was observed in the readable portion of the package.",
